  "equivalence_notes": [
    "TIME_BY (en) and TIME_UNTIL (en) both map to TO_UNTIL (hi); the verifier accepts either pairing and reports BY_UNTIL_AMBIGUOUS at info level.",
    "not before X == after X and not after X == before X when the event time is a single point; the verifier treats these as equivalent only for inclusive-neutral dates and reports REWRITE_EQUIVALENT.",
    "GT, GTE, LT, LTE are never interchangeable; a change between them is reported as COMPARISON_CHANGED.",
    "की जगह is not a relation; ignore."
